---
title: ProximaDB - Write Path End-to-End Sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant REST as REST/gRPC Handler
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware
    participant Tenant as TenantContext
    participant Lane as WriteLaneRouter
    participant DML as DmlService
    participant Plan as WritePlanner
    participant Exec as WriteExecutor
    participant Leases as PartitionLease
    participant Catalog as CatalogManager
    participant WAL as WriteAheadLog
    participant Mem as Memtable
    participant Flush as FlushMaterializer
    participant PAX as PAX Block Format
    participant ObjStore as ObjectStore
    participant Cache as CacheInvalidation
    participant Metrics as Billing/Observability

    Note over Client, Metrics: INSERT vector + metadata flow

    Client->>REST: POST /v1/collections/{id}/vectors (JSON/Proto)
    REST->>Auth: Validate JWT / API Key
    Auth-->>REST: identity + claims
    REST->>Tenant: Extract TenantContext (tenant_id, namespace_id)
    Note over Tenant: TenantContext carries isolation + billing boundary

    REST->>Lane: route_write(collection, operation)
    Lane->>Catalog: lookup_table(collection_id)
    Catalog-->>Lane: CatalogTableSchema + StorageLayout
    Note over Lane: Decision: DirectWal | CatalogRouting | IcebergWarehouse

    Lane->>DML: execute_write(plan, tenant_ctx)
    DML->>Plan: plan_write(request, schema, layout)
    Plan-->>DML: RoutedExecutionPlan

    DML->>Leases: acquire_partition_lease(tenant, collection)
    Leases-->>DML: DmlLockGuard (lease acquired)

    DML->>Exec: execute(plan, guard, tenant_ctx)
    Exec->>WAL: append(entries)
    Note over WAL: LSN assigned · configurable sync mode
    WAL-->>Exec: LSN committed

    Exec->>Mem: insert(records, lsn)
    Mem-->>Exec: acknowledged

    Exec->>Flush: schedule_flush(segment_id)
    Note over Flush: Background task triggered

    Exec-->>DML: WriteResult { count, lsns, ... }

    DML->>Cache: invalidate_query_cache(tenant, collection)
    Note over Cache: Write-path invalidation post-commit
    Cache-->>DML: invalidated

    DML->>Leases: release(guard)
    DML-->>REST: WriteResponse
    REST->>Metrics: emit(KSU: storage_bytes, KRU: write_ops)
    REST-->>Client: 200 OK { inserted, ids }

    Note over Flush,ObjStore: Async Background Flush
    Flush->>PAX: build_blocks(memtable_segment)
    PAX->>ObjStore: put_object(DrPath, blocks)
    Note over ObjStore: data/{tenant}/{ns}/{collection}/segments/...
    ObjStore-->>Flush: persisted
    Flush->>Catalog: update_segment_manifest()
    Flush->>Metrics: emit(KSU: storage_bytes_written)
